&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why PlayStation?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PlayStation&amp;nbsp;isn’t&amp;nbsp;just the Best Place to Play —&amp;nbsp;it’s&amp;nbsp;also the Best Place to Work. Today,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;recognized as a global leader in entertainment producing The PlayStation family of products and services including PlayStation®5, PlayStation®4,&amp;nbsp;PlayStation®VR,&amp;nbsp;PlayStation®Plus, acclaimed PlayStation software titles from PlayStation Studios, and more.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PlayStation also strives to create an inclusive environment that empowers employees and embraces diversity. We welcome and encourage everyone who has a passion and curiosity for innovation, technology, and play to explore our open positions and join our growing global team.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The PlayStation brand falls under Sony Interactive Entertainment, a wholly owned subsidiary&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195082176 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Sony Corporation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195082176 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Lead Character Tools Engineer to join the PlayStation Central Technology team focusing on Character technology from creation, rigging, and animation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Developing and distributing tools and optimizing for making the best characters in games more efficiently and integrating emergent technology into the future of game making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Candidate&amp;nbsp;expected to prototype,&amp;nbsp;create, and collaborate to deploy and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;tools and&amp;nbsp;practices from experience on traditional game development and run-time workflows with internal teams&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;seek new opportunities for bringing increased usage of AI and ML to make those processes more efficient.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;team of artists, engineers, and technical artists&amp;nbsp;partner&amp;nbsp;with engineering teams, studio stakeholders,&amp;nbsp;research engineers,&amp;nbsp;and other Central Technology&amp;nbsp;groups&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;cohesion&amp;nbsp;and standardization across PSS activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position requires&amp;nbsp;a demonstratable&amp;nbsp;understanding of&amp;nbsp;game development pipelines, extensive experience with Autodesk Maya software, and strong&amp;nbsp;programming skills.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;agentic workflows to accelerate code creation and testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
